Font (not MIT, not in the npm tarball)
--------------------------------------
The git tree contains BarcodeInterleaved2of5.ttf under assets/fonts/ for
historical and demo use. npm packages do not include that file.

Name table of the git file (verified): Copyright 2000; family
"Code 2/5 Interleaved"; version "1.00; June 21, 2000"; no license name IDs.

A nearby shareware family from Chaos Microsystems Inc. (1999) is documented
at https://luc.devroye.org/fonts-29893.html — "All rights reserved", not MIT.
This file is not confirmed to be that font (different name, year, size).

Host the TTF yourself next to the CSS (`../fonts/BarcodeInterleaved2of5.ttf`
relative to assets/css/barcode.css), or override @font-face. See the
repository NOTICE.
